<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  CRYSTAL_INGEST_EXECUTION_1 item 2 (design/Jawa/mods/crystal_mods_inventory.md ss1/ss3,
  ratified 2026-09-10): "gate its genstep to Lantern Deeps maps" for lee.theforce.
  lightsaber's kyber. Measured two things before touching anything (per the item's own
  "verify which genstep is actually firing" instruction, same discipline as the KOTOR
  discrepancy check):

  1. Force_CrystalFormation_{Small,Medium,Large} each ship `mineableScatterCommonality
     0.25` / `mineableScatterLumpSizeRange` with no biome gate === vanilla
     GenStep_RocksFromGrid (order 200) reads that field on every rocky player map, same
     universal-leak shape as pyrinth.
  2. The donor's OWN dedicated genstep, `Force_CrystalFormation` (ThingDef_Building/
     CrystalMapGenerator.xml, order 1100, Class Lightsaber.GenStep_ScatterLightsaberCrystals),
     is NOT wired into any MapGeneratorDef's genSteps list today === live def dump query:
     `SELECT def_name FROM defs WHERE def_type='MapGeneratorDef' AND
     json_extract(json,'$.fields.genSteps') LIKE '%Force_CrystalFormation%'` returns 0
     rows (mods=577/6fdca6f582164e2a, captured 2026-09-10T08:36:27Z). So it never fires
     via any known map generator, and needs no PatchOperationRemove today === only the
     universal mineableScatterCommonality leak (point 1) is a live problem.

  Zeroing mineableScatterCommonality here stops the universal vanilla scatter; the
  replacement Deeps-only scatter is RUT_LanternDeepKyberScatter.xml (referenced from
  RUT_LanternDeepGenerator's own genSteps list, which only ever generates a Lantern Deep
  pocket map).

  Patches the LIVE, ACTIVE donor defs directly (lee.theforce.lightsaber is not retired
  === see src/RimStarWars/Armoury/Defs/Absorbed_TheForceLightsaber/'s own header) rather
  than the dormant absorbed copy, because the donor's defs are what the running game
  actually loads today.
-->
<Patch>

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>Star Wars : The Force - Lightsaber</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>

        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Force_CrystalFormation_Small"]/building/mineableScatterCommonality</xpath>
          <value>
            <mineableScatterCommonality>0</mineableScatterCommonality>
          </value>
        </li>

        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Force_CrystalFormation_Medium"]/building/mineableScatterCommonality</xpath>
          <value>
            <mineableScatterCommonality>0</mineableScatterCommonality>
          </value>
        </li>

        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Force_CrystalFormation_Large"]/building/mineableScatterCommonality</xpath>
          <value>
            <mineableScatterCommonality>0</mineableScatterCommonality>
          </value>
        </li>

      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
